        "summaryTimestamp": 1790848860000
      },
      {
        "id": "parity-overview",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "We can investigate two independent questions: how the desktop renders an answer, and how the project preserves its data. Each branch can continue before the synthesis.",
        "timestamp": 1790848920000,
